;; The six namespaces carried from jasalt/jolt-android-experiment at 6d2b291.
;;
;; :file       where this repo keeps it.
;; :upstream   the path it has upstream.
;; :ns         each namespace name used here -> the name upstream has.
;; :notebook-sha  what the glimmer-ios-demo notebooks recorded for the upstream
;;             bytes: the full sha256, or its first 16 hex digits where the
;;             notebooks kept only a prefix.
;; :sha        sha256 of the upstream file with all whitespace removed. Measured
;;             from the first commit that carried them, where :notebook-sha
;;             matches the raw bytes. Five of the six have been through
;;             clojure-lsp format since (4c23d11), which only moves whitespace,
;;             so the raw hash no longer matches them and this one does.
;;
;; The identity test puts the upstream names back into :file, strips the
;; whitespace and compares with :sha. tools/extract-from-notebooks reads this
;; too. A fresh extraction is raw upstream bytes, so it is checked against
;; :notebook-sha instead.
[{:file     "src/net/b12n/raylib_ios/scenes/flappy_bird.cljc"
  :upstream "src/poc/raylib/flappy_bird.cljc"
